piewifi (1) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * piewifi 1
  * src/openbsd-src is OpenBSD's 8.0 release on master, commit
    58ef3138855e39db066749e3b8e95b21b7471144.
  * PIE80211Family.kext: OpenBSD's net80211 for a station, with open
    networks and WPA2-PSK with CCMP.
  * PIEbwfm.kext: OpenBSD's bwfm for the CYW43455 of the Raspberry Pi 4
    and 500, with the firmware of pie-firmware-brcm.
  * pie-wifi: joins, lists and forgets networks, scans and shows the link.
    pie-wifi watch gives the stored networks to each WiFi interface as it
    appears.

 -- Maxwell <maxwell@blueberrypieos.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:17:38 +0000
